Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(捷克布拉格帕里斯卡血库)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次卖血?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First time giving blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:00.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们付现金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They pay cash here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不管你卖过多少次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's no limit to how many times you give.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连瓶装的都肯买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They even buy it in the jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查德诺玛 轮到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jared Nomak, we're ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去一年内有没有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the past 12 months, have you gotten a tattoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...刺青或其他刺穿皮肤举动?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or undergone any ear, skin, or body piercings?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:33.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你下巴的疤是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get that scar on your chin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:34.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小时候出过意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Childhood accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你没有任何近亲 对不?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say you don't have any immediate next of kin, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少没跟任何近亲连络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that I'm in contact with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 万一有紧急事故没人可连络?  - 一个都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nobody to call in case of an emergency?  - No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有家人? 跟你说过 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No family? I told you, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我不能捐血?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you telling me I can't be a donor?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不一定 你的验血结果不寻常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It depends. We came up with some unusual results on your blood test.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 多不寻常?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? How? How unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你血液中含有稀有的显型体 我们从未见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your blood has a very rare phenotype, one we haven't encountered before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你们是谁? 不 不  - 请坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? No. No.  - Sit down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是好坏参半的局面 查德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a good news-bad news scenario, Jared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我们是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good news for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却是坏事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad news...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.56,0:02:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...对你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:23.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群吸血鬼!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最恨吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘掉你们自以为了解的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget what you think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸血鬼确实存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本人刀锋战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天生半人半吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born half human, half vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:04:01.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他吸血鬼叫我白昼游侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They call me The Deywelker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拥有他们的力量 却没有他们的弱点...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have all their strengths, none of their weaknesses...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...除了同样嗜血如命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...except for the thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十年前 一个人改变了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty years ago, I met a man that changed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惠斯勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他教我如何控制嗜血的冲动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He taught me how to hold the thirst at bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教我狩猎法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taught me the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也给了我狩猎工具:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gave me the weapons to hunt with:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银器 大蒜 阳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silver, garlic, sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二年前 他遭到攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two years ago, he was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被逮去变成我最恨的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took him, and turned him into the thing I hate most.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早该了结他的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have finished him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 我正在猎捕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm hunting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都阻挡不了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And nothing will stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:02.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《刀锋战士2》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:21.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白昼游侠来了! 拦住他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daywalker's here! Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.04,0:05:45.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去他妈的!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道他们将他藏在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我去找他 我放你一马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me to him, and I'll consider you a loose end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他举枪自杀变成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.17,0:08:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只是维持他的性命!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:42.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你去! 我带你去!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是罗许 让我进去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要开枪! 是我!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干!不是银的但痛得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待会再收拾你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他们怎么对待你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at what they've done to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.60,0:13:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看紧你们的女儿 黑骑士来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock up your daughters, boys and girls, the dark knight returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:28.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哈一管吗, 刀兄?  - 待会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Need a toke of the smokage there, B?  - Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灯关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得不妙 刀兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a bad feeling about this, B.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听他的呼吸 他快挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unh! Listen to his breathing. He's already dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:14:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很痛苦 不如给他个痛快?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in pain. Why don't you just put him out of his misery?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们将他滞留在变身剂中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had him on stasis in a halfway house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要为他加速逆转解毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm giving him an accelerated retro-viral detox.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像戒海洛因瘾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a heroin addict.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊!  - 让他一夜就恢复正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Agh!  - Make him go cold turkey in one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:13.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的没用的 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit ain't gonna work, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.32,0:14:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我建议杀了这王八蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say you kill the motherfucker right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管有没有东西残留你体内 惠斯勒 听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's anything left of you in there, Whistler, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.32,0:14:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一早 我会拉开窗帘...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the morning, those blinds are going to open...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...不管你复原了没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whether you're cured or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老兄 我不是有意…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, I didn't mean to call him...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说 刀锋战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你必须把我干掉  - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna have to finish me off.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.72,0:15:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枪给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that damn gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:53.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个傻小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stubborn son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:49.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像被毒打了一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like hammered shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从莫斯科开始 然后罗马尼亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Started out in Moscow, then Romania.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们不断将你藏在不同地方  - 我消失了多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They kept moving you around.  - How long was I gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好几个月?  - 非常久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Months?  - Too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好几年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:30.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把我折磨得半死...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd torture me almost to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...然后丢在血桶里治疗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then let me heal in a vat of blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...以便再折磨我一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so they could go at it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些混蛋也不顺便医好我的脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry sons of bitches could have at least fixed my goddamn leg while they were at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的高压焊枪呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my arc welder?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:07.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惠斯勒 幸会 久仰大名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler, nice to meet you, man. I heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫乔许 外号人称飞毛腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Josh. You can call me Scud, though. Everybody does.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我问你 毛毛腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something, Skid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是飞毛腿 类似千里马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, man, it's Scud. Scud, like "stud."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 飞毛腿  - 随便啦 你在这里干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Scud.  - Whatever. What did you do in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:33.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说这辆酷车? 做点个性化改装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pimpmobile? Just a little after-market modification.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 二氧化氮燃料之类的  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nitrous oxide and shit like that.  - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:39.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想改良排气系统加大马力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave it a more aggressive exhaust profile ramping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全套改装后马力直逼300匹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whole package will crank that Betty up maybe 300 horsepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不到下次换机油引擎就缩缸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll burn the damned thing out before your next oil change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这屎蛋你哪里找来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you dig up this shitbird, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:50.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪里不爽 老头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is your problem, Poppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我他妈吸了两年血块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My problem is l've been sucking blood clots for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易脱身却看到个猪头 瞎整我毕生的结晶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get out to find some jerkoff fucking with my life's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:18:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荒废我们的业务专心伺候你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We jeopardized our operation to save your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们的业务?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Our operation"?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的? 我一手建立的 废人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Our operation"? I built this operation, you ass-wipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警报系统 第三区 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motion sensors. It's on three, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.64,0:19:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,体温50度 应该是吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, body temperature, 50. I'd guess suckhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烧坏了 他们用镁光枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fried. They're using magnesium flares.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的保全系统被破解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got your security system scoped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:33.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇喔 哇喔 哇喔 我信不过你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. whoa. whoa, I don't trust you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇喔 哇喔 哇喔...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衣服很炫哟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开上帝灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guard lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妮莎! 把剑拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.10,0:22:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的人先开火的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是来送口信的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是吸血鬼执政党的代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We represent the ruling body of the Vampire Nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.64,0:22:34.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们希望跟你谈休战协定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're offering you a truce.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:37.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,期待跟你见个面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to meet with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞毛腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scud.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面罩拿下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off your mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫亚萨 这位是妮莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Asad. This is Nyssa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.28,0:23:03.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我们最敬畏的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been our most feared enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.24,0:23:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但近来外面有个家伙胆大妄为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now there's something else loose on the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比你还可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something worse than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么好笑?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.12,0:23:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面传言刀锋战士有多吓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They tell stories about Blade as the bogeyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说 我有点失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankly, I'm disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.00,0:23:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了没 刀兄? 她很失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that, B? She's disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.08,0:23:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两三下就答应跟我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He agreed to come along so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的宝贝让她瞧瞧 拜托?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, B, show her. Pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.76,0:23:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桑坦克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Semtex.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,足够夷平整条街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough explosives to level a city block.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.48,0:23:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还失望吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.64,0:24:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警卫看起来像人 刀兄 可能是冥族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guards look human, B. They're probably familiars.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.80,0:24:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不后悔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.44,0:24:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有什么不对劲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I'm not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.40,0:24:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸血鬼帝国的真正力量在此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The true power of the Vampire Nation lies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.56,0:25:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.16,0:25:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋战士 这位是至高大公 艾里大·马基诺斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade, this is Overlord Eli Damaskinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.48,0:25:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白昼游侠 欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.36,0:25:34.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常言道 "以敌人为荣 坐享他的成就"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has been said, "Be proud of your enemy and enjoy his success."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.36,0:25:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此看来 我该感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that regard, I should thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.96,0:25:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么说?  - 替我们除掉戴肯·佛洛斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For what?  - Eliminating Deacon Frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.24,0:25:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮个忙 凯洛·酷南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did us a favor. Karel Kounen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是人类  - 差一点点 我是律师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're human.  - Barely. I'm a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:25:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧洲保健国际财团法人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}European Health Consortium.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.52,0:25:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如你所知 吸血习性是一种传染性病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you may know, vampirism is a horrible virus...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.36,0:25:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...透过掠食者唾液散播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...carried in the saliva of predators.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.52,0:26:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,病毒72小时内流遍人体血管...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 72 hours, it spreads through the human bloodstream...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.08,0:26:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...繁衍出寄生性组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...creating new parasitic organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.08,0:26:08.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有如癌细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具目的性的癌细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cancer with a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.88,0:26:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不幸 病毒也会进化 我们已经发现新进化种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, viruses evolve too. We've encountered a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.48,0:26:21.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命名为"R异体"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We dubbed it the Reaper strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.72,0:26:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟所有优良病原体一样 它迅速找到带原者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And like any good pathogen, it appears to have found a carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.60,0:26:36.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他 查德·诺玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, Jared Nomak.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.40,0:26:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天生吸血鬼 但跟你一样是异种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born a vampire, but an anomaly like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.36,0:26:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不像我们其他人 然而...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlike the rest of us, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.16,0:26:50.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...他不但吸食人类 也可以靠吸血鬼维生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he feeds on not just humans, but vampires as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.56,0:26:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看来他是在帮我忙  - 你没听清楚重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looks like he was doing me a favor.  - You're missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.88,0:26:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被吸食的吸血鬼不会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their vampire victims don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.20,0:27:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们转而变成带原者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They turn. They become carriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.40,0:27:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.04,0:27:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们像中快克瘾 他们得天天满足瘾头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things are like crack addicts. They need to feed daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.32,0:27:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺玛已经现身72小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nomak's been up for 72 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:12.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据我们估计已有打上R异体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By our estimates, there are already a dozen Reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.48,0:27:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本周结束前会有数百个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There'll be hundreds before the week is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个月后数千人 算算看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thousands within a matter of months. Do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.36,0:27:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我先弄清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, let me get this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.44,0:27:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我为你猎捕他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to hunt them for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.28,0:27:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对付完我们后 你想他会找上谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they are finished with us, who do you think they'll turn on next?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.56,0:27:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你珍贵的人类?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your precious humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.44,0:27:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个也不能幸免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not one of them will be left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.80,0:27:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两年来我们训练一个战术小组"护血队"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We spent two years training a small tactical unit, the Bloodpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.00,0:27:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你来领导他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want you to lead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.00,0:27:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两年?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.96,0:27:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来是训练来猎杀你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been training to hunt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.48,0:27:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 刀兄 你认为如何?  - 听起来计划还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, B-man, what do you think?  - Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.12,0:27:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你的真正想法呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you really think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.20,0:28:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一有机会他们就会反咬我一口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna fuck us the first chance they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.36,0:28:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们不答应 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't gonna do this, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.44,0:28:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先陪他们玩玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll play along for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.72,0:28:10.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以深入他们的组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll take us in deeper than we've ever been.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.64,0:28:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,利用机会了解他们的运作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a chance to see how their world really ticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.80,0:28:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经够了解他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had enough of their world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.64,0:28:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已经屁滚尿流 食物链顶层的地位不保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're just shitting bricks because they're no longer top of the food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.72,0:28:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠 我很担心他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, man, I'm really worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.84,0:28:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是你朋友 但还是得留心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know he's your friend and all, but I think you should watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.80,0:28:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人一夜就能恢复正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody goes cold turkey from the thirst in just one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想舒畅舒畅吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking to get hooked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.56,0:29:19.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看罗 你有什么好货?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe. What do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.12,0:29:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题 海洛因 夏威夷极品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem. Horse, Hawaiian ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.00,0:29:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要什么有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.24,0:29:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要什么有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.68,0:29:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了 如果我要你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like that. What if I need you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好甜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.60,0:30:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们随时待命 白昼游侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are ready whenever you are, Daywalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋战士 跟护血队见个面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade, meet the Bloodpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.68,0:30:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光斧 魏莲...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lighthammer, Verlaine...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.28,0:30:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...教士 雪人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Priest, Snowman...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.96,0:30:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...丘巴以及雷哈特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Chupa and Reinhardt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.68,0:31:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.28,0:31:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这夥人很怀疑...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and the gang were wondering....
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.16,0:31:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.28,0:31:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会不会脸红?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you blush?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帅哦 老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go, Poppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.88,0:31:30.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 我懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.36,0:31:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂你的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.56,0:31:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们受训两年 目的要作掉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been training for two years to take me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.20,0:31:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到却变成这局面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.92,0:31:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.52,0:31:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 很爽 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, so exciting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.80,0:31:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 给你们一个机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here's your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.20,0:31:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊 上啊 等什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.88,0:31:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在你们面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I am, right here in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.88,0:31:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希特勒 你先上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adolf here gets the first shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.04,0:32:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上啊 看她干嘛? 要她批准吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. What are you looking at her for? You need permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.72,0:32:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要奖励吗 好 我可以帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you need a little bit of incentive. Okay, I can help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.40,0:32:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事? 打不到?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? Missed that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.40,0:32:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 再来一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, I can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.08,0:32:16.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 雷哈特 要操作手册吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. What, you need a manual?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.80,0:32:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 干掉他!  - 上啊! 干掉他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kill the bastard!  - Do it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.40,0:32:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你后脑挂了一个爆裂物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you've got an explosive device stuck to the back of your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.92,0:32:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硝酸银 谁敢碰它 它就会炸开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silver nitrate, rigged to go off if anybody tampers with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.92,0:32:37.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我随身带着引信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have the detonator with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.60,0:32:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 如果看我不顺眼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, if you so much as look at me wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.68,0:32:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.28,0:32:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在开始 我们并肩作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From now on, we work as a unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.08,0:32:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们得听我的命令行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be taking orders from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.88,0:33:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.32,0:33:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要抓猎人先从猎物下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to catch the hunter, you start with the prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.60,0:33:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标摆在吸血鬼夜间聚集地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll target all the night places where vampires congregate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.80,0:33:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血库 巢穴 越大越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood banks, safe houses, the bigger, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.36,0:33:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里是第一个目标?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's first?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.84,0:33:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛苦之屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The House of Pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.80,0:33:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,入口在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.56,0:33:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没招牌 没吸血鬼雕像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see any signs, no vampire glyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.96,0:33:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 因为你我们得改变习惯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, because of you, we've had to rethink our habits...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.00,0:33:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...加强安全措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tighten our security.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.00,0:33:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仔细搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.56,0:34:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.04,0:34:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,38 .45跟9厘米的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-eight, .45 and 9mm caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.16,0:34:13.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖端都有个小胶囊 里面是硝酸银和大蒜萃取物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All with foil capsules at the tip filled with silver nitrate and garlic extract.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.72,0:34:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这把高速箭枪 射出的银箭速度达每秒六千尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This hyper-velocity stake gun spits out a silver stake at 6000 feet per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.20,0:34:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于你们害怕阳光...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you suckers don't like sunlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.80,0:34:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...瞄准仪特别加装了紫外线滤镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we've modified the gun's entry light with a UV filter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.64,0:34:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滤镜打开 立刻射出紫外线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pop it open, instant UV light.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.20,0:34:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 盖上滤镜则无杀伤力  - 刀兄 你看看这玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Filter's on, no problem.  - Yo, B, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.68,0:34:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它装有气压注射系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got a pneumatic syringe delivery system.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.08,0:34:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,药瓶内装的是EDTA抗凝血剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The vials are filled with an anticoagulant called EDTA.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.52,0:34:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打一针 目标立刻涨得像气球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One punch with this blows your target up like a balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.24,0:34:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹匣跳出 自动重新上膛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cartridge ejects. Automatic reload.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.76,0:34:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.56,0:34:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.88,0:34:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们没有人相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't pass for one of us. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.56,0:34:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 希罕  - 不 他说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like I give a shit.  - No, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.20,0:34:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么不到屋顶上去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you post up on the roof over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.92,0:35:01.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掩护我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover our backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来由护血队发号施令啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the Bloodpack's calling the shots now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.76,0:35:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.60,0:35:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗儿管好 不然我替你管教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better curb that dog of yours or we'll do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.12,0:35:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想找死 白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep pushing, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.76,0:36:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.16,0:36:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你即将进入我们的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about to enter our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.48,0:36:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会看到一些事情 比如说进食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will see things, feeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.20,0:36:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记住你来此的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just remember why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.64,0:36:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没有忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.28,0:36:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来这里找什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What exactly are we looking for in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.72,0:36:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何可疑的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything that looks suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.80,0:36:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.32,0:36:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你们怎么得到猎人 叫我看看你们的欲望 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ What y'all get it ain't haunted, call it I see some of y'all thirsty for it. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:37:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 直接针对你们战斗 狗 我是工作狂 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Straight frontin'y'all winnin'come down To the combat, dog, I'm a workaholic. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.56,0:37:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 在我的扳机下射杀所有敌人 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ My swag touches every enemy Within my clutches. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.08,0:37:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 刀锋制造威胁 就要靠你所了解的 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Black makin'that ruckus And I'm puttin'that lean on all you suckas. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.40,0:37:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 刀锋! 你的力量压垮所有对手 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Black! Your bone crushes Every opponent suffers. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.36,0:37:14.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你不喜欢打击对手? ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Your tone hushes from punches Don't you like percussion? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.80,0:37:16.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 不要失去你的生活 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Don't lose yo life for nothin'. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.64,0:37:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你不想去接触它们 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ You don't wanna try to touch 'em. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.36,0:37:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 没有竞争 听着 这不是公开讨论 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ No competition, listen This ain't open for discussion. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.68,0:37:24.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你想要它 希望它来 你想要它 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ He, you want it, want it Come on, you want it. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.80,0:37:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你想要它那就来吧 哈哈 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Ha, come on, you want it, want it. Ha, you want it, come on. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.40,0:37:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞毛腿 听到请回答?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scud, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.36,0:37:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 能看到我吗?  - 非常清楚 刀兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You reading me?  - Reading you loud and clear, B.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个大巢穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole place is a safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.04,0:37:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,窗户漆黑 有道逃生门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Windows are painted black, one access door.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.56,0:38:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 二 三百个吸血鬼在这里  - 酷毙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Two-or 300 suckheads in here.  - That sounds cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.92,0:38:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 老惠 听得到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, W, you got me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.52,0:38:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老惠?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}W?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.76,0:38:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我 上面天气如何 亲爱的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something, how's the weather up there, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.04,0:38:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,享受日光浴呢 大麻鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walking on sunshine, toad boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.84,0:38:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.08,0:38:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们大半不是纯种吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half of these bastards, they're not even purebloods.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.68,0:38:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.04,0:38:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们为什么不杀光它们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we just fucking kill everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.56,0:38:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免得有漏网之鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.60,0:38:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好机会 要杀他还不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, it would be so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.64,0:39:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他瞄准你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.92,0:39:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.40,0:39:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白昼游侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daywalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.84,0:40:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 饿饿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother's milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.24,0:40:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离日出半大约小时 灰姑娘们 动作快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we got about half an hour till sunrise, Cinderella. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.76,0:41:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到一个但跟丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spotted one, but lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.76,0:41:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提高警觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be on the lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.28,0:41:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.24,0:43:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惠斯勒 车顶上有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler, man, they're on the roof. On the roof of my bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.00,0:43:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.12,0:44:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nomak.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.80,0:44:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白昼游侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daywalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.24,0:44:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我招惹你了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.72,0:44:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人的敌人是朋友还是敌人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the enemy of my enemy my friend or my enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.16,0:44:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.64,0:45:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遭受攻击 有三个 可能不只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're under attack! There's three of them. Probably more.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.28,0:45:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.30,0:45:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么怪东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.52,0:47:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银弹没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silver don't do shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.44,0:47:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要浪费子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't waste the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.60,0:47:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 见鬼了  - 听到没有 丘巴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Motherfucker.  - You hear me, Chupa?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.68,0:47:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say "cheese."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.60,0:47:25.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.68,0:48:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日光浴吗 王八蛋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about some daylight, motherfucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.20,0:49:33.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丑陋的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.76,0:50:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.78,0:50:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你流血了 被咬吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.12,0:50:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背后 背后受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.24,0:51:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说 被攻击的话 用紫外光 他们受不了光线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. If you're under attack, use your UV lights. They can't take the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.36,0:51:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.04,0:52:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能死在这里 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not dying here, man. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.28,0:52:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教士挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Priest is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.36,0:52:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日出了 你得孤军奋战 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daylight's coming. You're on your own, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.88,0:52:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你处心积虑找我 刀锋战士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me so bad, Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.04,0:52:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.44,0:52:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要杀我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.96,0:52:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你我有共同的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I, we have the same enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.36,0:52:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的目标一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.88,0:54:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的需求相同 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need the same thing, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.88,0:55:28.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.80,0:55:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么没说他们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell me these things were immune...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.20,0:55:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- ...对银制品和大蒜免疫?  - 我并不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...to silver and garlic?  - I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.72,0:55:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果知道 你会说吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you did, would you have told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.28,0:55:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你听到就会知道事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you know the truth when you hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.16,0:55:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为什么没把你杀了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why didn't he kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.00,0:55:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他被咬多久了?  - 大约20分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long since he's been bitten?  - About 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.40,0:55:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他的皮肤滚烫  - 他已经开始蜕变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His skin is fucking burning.  - He's already starting to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.40,0:56:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁来让他住嘴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will someone just shut him the fuck up?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.23,0:56:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了我 丘巴!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.41,0:56:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无惧之人...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.76,0:56:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.96,0:56:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 扶着他 丘巴  - 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold him, Chupa!  - Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.60,0:56:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他一个痛快吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just put him out of his fucking misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.08,0:56:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样杀不了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you get it? You can't finish him that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.60,0:56:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按着他 按着他 丘巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold him down. Hold him down, Chupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.24,0:56:39.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.12,0:56:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.58,0:56:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.60,0:57:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这个绝招 你们麻烦大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that was your Bloodpack Sunday punch, we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.88,0:57:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王八蛋擅离岗位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This motherfucker left his post.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.92,0:57:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他刚失踪了  - 你去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He just disappeared.  - Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.76,0:57:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也跟个R异体过了几招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ran into a little Reaper action myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.76,0:57:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 是吗? 过了几招? 我们损失了一个队友 教士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? How little? We lost a man, Priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.48,0:57:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我在你胸口刻上他的名字吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to carve his fucking name on your chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.48,0:57:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你们去看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.08,0:57:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巷子里有动静于是我就跟过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saw it moving in the alley and followed it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.44,0:57:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现这个状况 我想他们从这儿进出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found it just like this. I think they came through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.12,0:57:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想爬回下水道 手臂被卡住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was trying to crawl back in the culvert and caught his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.20,0:57:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他像土狼般想咬断自己手臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been gnawing at it like a coyote.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.24,0:57:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜的男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little boy blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.04,0:57:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他快死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's already dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.00,0:57:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得尽快检查他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to examine it as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.96,0:57:56.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 找根杠杆把它撬开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look for a lever. Let's open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.12,0:58:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们跟R异体碰上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've made contact with the Reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.24,0:58:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有伤亡吗?  - 目前为止一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any casualties?  - One so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.08,0:58:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信不是妮莎吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not Nyssa, I trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.48,0:58:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.44,0:58:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个危险游戏 大马基诺斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This a dangerous game you're playing, Damaskinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.36,0:58:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋战士暴烈不可测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade is too volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.96,0:58:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有办法继续操纵他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't be able to keep manipulating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.20,0:58:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太过担心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.00,0:58:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据内线通报一切依计划进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been informed by our friend inside that events are unfolding as scripted.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.48,0:58:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经损失一个自己人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've already lost one of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.64,0:58:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你愿意牺牲几个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many more are you willing to sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.04,0:58:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 每个都可以牺牲  - 即使是自己的女儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Every one.  - Even your own daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.96,0:59:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 即使是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, even her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.08,0:59:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认得这东西吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognize this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.04,0:59:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血库的 他是其中一位警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blood bank. He's one of the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.36,0:59:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么会死? 为何致命?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why is he dying? What's killing him?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.04,0:59:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.12,0:59:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新陈代谢太快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His metabolism is burning too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.80,0:59:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几个小时就需要新鲜的血 不然就开始消耗自己的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need fresh blood every couple of hours or they'll start feeding on themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.92,0:59:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺玛不同 他是带原者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nomak's different. He's the carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.52,0:59:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切从他开始 也由他结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all started with him, it'll end with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.56,1:00:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 把他的嘴打开 飞毛腿  - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Open the mouth, Scud.  - Heh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.16,1:00:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他的嘴打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.92,1:00:11.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀兄 别叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B, man, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.84,1:00:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娘娘腔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sissy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.88,1:00:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 嘎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugh. Gah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.24,1:00:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有舌头会携带病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the tongue carries the virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.12,1:00:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,病毒从倒钩喷射出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is injected through these barbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.84,1:00:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咬筋岔成两股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has bifurcated masseter muscles.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.68,1:00:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,极度发达使咬噬非常有力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overdeveloped, allowing for a much stronger bite.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.72,1:00:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,颚部结构没有改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaw structure remains the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.20,1:00:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没有下颚骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's no mandible bone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.36,1:00:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,压他的牙齿 飞毛腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squeeze that tooth, Scud.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.56,1:01:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神经毒素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neurotoxin.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.96,1:01:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用来麻醉受害者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably paralyzes their victim while they feed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.56,1:01:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大蒜 银制品都拿他没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garlic don't work. Silver, that don't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.96,1:01:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只能靠阳光 对吧?  - 但对我们也会致命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We gotta go with the sunlight, right?  - That's deadly to us too.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.16,1:01:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想看有没有其他办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's see what else we can find.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.04,1:01:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的伤口好多了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.51,1:01:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好得相当快
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.60,1:01:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,R异体跟我们大不相同 就像我们跟你们不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These things are as different from us as we are from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.04,1:02:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.60,1:02:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心脏包藏在骨头里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heart is encased in bone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.32,1:02:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只有侧边会受到伤害  - 靠运气才能射穿骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Only the side is vulnerable.  - Good luck getting a stake through that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.92,1:02:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拔下的蜘蛛脚会自行走动...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull a leg off a spider, it keeps moving on its own...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.56,1:02:14.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...没有身体它还是会走路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...essentially trying to walk without a body attached to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.16,1:02:17.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛?  - 瞧瞧什么叫杀不死?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the fuck are you doing?  - Hardwired, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.24,1:02:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.08,1:02:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑部已经死亡 身体还能进食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brain's dead. Body's still trying to feed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.96,1:02:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离天亮还有六小时 事先准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got six hours before sunrise. Be ready by then.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.92,1:02:41.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 日出要干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what happens at sunrise?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.68,1:02:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋战士 我在跟你说话 日出要干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade, I'm talking to you. What happens at sunrise?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.72,1:02:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去猎杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.44,1:02:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 光天化日之下?  - 你开什么玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In broad daylight?  - You gotta be fucking joking.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.56,1:02:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擦点防晒油 温室小花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better get you some sunscreen, buttercup.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.20,1:02:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 屎蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, shitkicker.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.80,1:02:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没死绝算你他妈好狗运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about one cunt hair away from hillbilly heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.16,1:03:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说脏话真好听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it when you talk dirty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.40,1:03:07.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳光是我们唯一的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunlight's the only edge we've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.08,1:03:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 只有靠它才伤得了他们  - 我们也受不了阳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They'll be more vulnerable then.  - And so will we.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.80,1:03:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对事实吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's be real about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.12,1:03:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不敢奢望大家平安归来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't expect everybody to make it back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.16,1:03:24.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得随时保护自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember to protect yourselves at all times.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.48,1:03:34.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在找什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.48,1:03:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,磷光棒 如果能够找到光源...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phosphor rods. If I can suss out the light source...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.48,1:03:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...或许能做些紫外光手榴弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...maybe I can make some sort of UV flash-bang grenade or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.80,1:03:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been tried already.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.40,1:03:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你没有飞毛腿的天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but you didn't have the Scudster working on it then, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.72,1:04:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 刀锋  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Blade.  - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.92,1:04:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你跟他们说话的方式  - 怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The way you talk to them, us.  - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.40,1:04:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是队友 记得吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are together in this, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.96,1:04:09.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么那么恨我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you hate us so much?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.56,1:04:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.92,1:04:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 打从骨子里不喜欢  - 很好 我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's in my blood.  - Well, it's in mine too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.44,1:04:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是血统纯正的吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a pureblood. I was born a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.88,1:04:28.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比谁都了解嗜血的感觉 从血液里直奔而出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the thirst better than any of us, shooting that serum of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.64,1:04:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们唯一的不同 是我早已接受了事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only difference between us is that I made peace with what I am a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.76,1:04:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你跟刀锋战士认识多久了?  - 快20年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long have you known Blade?  - Going on 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.68,1:04:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不太爱谈过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't talk about the old days that much.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.60,1:04:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么事都不太爱说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade doesn't talk about anything much.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.28,1:04:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想听件有趣的事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to hear something funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.36,1:04:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋战士把你看成父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade kind of looks at you like a father figure.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.80,1:04:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说来听听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.12,1:05:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么认识的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you two hook up?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.64,1:05:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我背包旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was backpacking.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.28,1:05:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一次徒步旅行碰到两个妓女...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I met these two chicks, decided to take them back to my, uh, tent...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.64,1:05:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- ...我决定带她们回帐篷玩3P  - 帅哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...for a little Three's Company action.  - Pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.88,1:05:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪料到她们开始撕我的腹肌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next thing I know, Janet and Chrissy start tearing chunks out of my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.84,1:05:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋救我一命 自然变成朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade shows up, saves my ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.88,1:05:19.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都解决了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything else just sort of fell into place.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.52,1:05:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 试试看  - 好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's try it.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.44,1:05:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被你说对了 没屁用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I fucked up. Maybe you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.32,1:05:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帅呆了 老爹有样新武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Papa's got a brand new bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.76,1:06:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask one question.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.88,1:06:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到哪找R异体?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell are we gonna find these Reapers?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.24,1:06:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不必找 他们会送上门来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't have to. They'll come to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.56,1:06:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么玩意?  - 费洛蒙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is this shit?  - Pheromones.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.72,1:06:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从R异体肾上腺萃取的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harvested from the Reapers'adrenal glands.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.36,1:06:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会被吸引过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna key to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.40,1:06:55.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要我们靠屌臊味诱出R异体?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want us to spray on some suckpuppy's nut juice?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.48,1:06:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先用火力逐退他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First use your firearms to drive them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.36,1:07:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后丢紫外光手榴弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then toss your UV grenades.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.04,1:07:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我们的终极决定版\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. This is what we got for the grand finale.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.44,1:07:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将这玩意连接上硝化甘油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hot-wired a couple of these babies to a nitro-vaceem.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.04,1:07:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火时格外小心 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be real careful where you pop your load, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.36,1:07:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢 你不去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, you're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.20,1:07:15.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我爱好和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm a lover, not a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.00,1:07:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫外光会延迟10秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}UVs have a 10-second delay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.68,1:07:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得要找掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nyssa, just remember to take cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.64,1:07:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋 帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Blade, give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.60,1:07:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟那妞倒蛮来电的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Miss Muffet getting a little cozy there?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.88,1:07:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我如果是你 我不会多管闲事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't worry about that if I was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.08,1:07:43.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你搞不清楚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks to me like you're getting confused...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.24,1:07:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...自己站哪边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as to which side of the line you're standing on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.84,1:07:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无聊人说无聊话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are real hollow words coming from a man...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.28,1:07:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...你跟敌人混了两年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who just spent two years running with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.80,1:07:56.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这话是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what the hell is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.28,1:08:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你懂的 惠斯勒 有句老话说:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Whistler, there's an old saying:
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.64,1:08:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"亲近朋友 但要更亲近敌人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Keep your friends close, but keep your enemies closer."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.84,1:08:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你记住这句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might want to remember that.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.64,1:08:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋 我们应该分成三组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade, we should split into three units.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.64,1:09:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要引诱 不是吓跑他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trying to attract them, not scare them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.84,1:09:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在黑暗里看不见 秃子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, some of us can't see in the dark, you fucking nipplehead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.24,1:09:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.12,1:10:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带老花眼镜啊 阿公 跟好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bifocals, Grandpa, and try to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.19,1:10:52.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光斧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.72,1:10:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.48,1:11:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 乡巴佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hillbilly.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.32,1:11:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.08,1:11:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里四下无人呢 温室小花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't nobody here but you and us, buttercup.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.36,1:11:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们挂了个战友 刀锋战士也得挂一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lose a partner, and Blade loses one!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.32,1:11:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让你们两个相亲相爱一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll leave you two lovebirds some time to yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.88,1:12:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魏莲?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Verlaine?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.62,1:13:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(10秒自动引爆器)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.56,1:13:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东地道里发现一群R异体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spotted a group in the east tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.44,1:13:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正在设定炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm prepping the bomb pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.64,1:13:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妮莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nyssa.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.60,1:13:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.12,1:13:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.12,1:13:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.24,1:13:48.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.68,1:13:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他们引过来 照我的话做 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll attract them to me. Do what I tell you. Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.32,1:13:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10秒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.04,1:14:00.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...9秒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...nine...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.96,1:14:02.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...8秒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...eight...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.80,1:14:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...7秒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...seven...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.48,1:14:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...6秒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Six...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.00,1:14:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...5秒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...five...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.16,1:14:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...4秒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...four...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.24,1:14:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...3秒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...three...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.64,1:14:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...2秒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...two...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.72,1:14:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...1秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.49,1:14:40.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷哈特... 招集组员!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.08,1:14:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烂东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piece of junk.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.46,1:14:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丘巴
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.56,1:14:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...马上离开那里!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.48,1:15:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.72,1:15:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想臭死我啊 老头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You trying to stink me to death, old man?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.95,1:15:05.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丘巴
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.55,1:15:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上离开那里!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.76,1:15:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.20,1:15:21.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧?  - 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.60,1:15:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走 来了一大票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta move. We got a lot of company.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.04,1:15:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各单位集合 集合!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units, regroup. Regroup!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.68,1:16:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃屎吧 丑巴怪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat shit, you ugly motherfuckers!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.16,1:16:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里没有人了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nobody left!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.00,1:16:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah! Unh.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.36,1:16:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 炸药包呢?  - 我不得不丢在那边地道里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the bomb pack?  - Had to leave it down that tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.24,1:16:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的费洛蒙给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the rest of the pheromones.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.88,1:16:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进那条地道去 快 快 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go down that tunnel. Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.04,1:16:43.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们显然搞不清楚你们惹上了谁!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You obviously do not know who you are fucking with!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.72,1:17:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋战士 我有没有告诉你炸弹的控制杆卡住了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, Blade, did I happen to mention the bomb lever is stuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.00,1:17:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃个够吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suck this!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.16,1:17:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.24,1:18:17.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想咬我吗? 很好 来啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a bite of me? Well, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.24,1:18:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊 孬种!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.52,1:19:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惠斯勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.32,1:19:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.60,1:19:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会饶你一命...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will survive this...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.64,1:19:46.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...让你转告刀锋战士...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...only to tell Blade...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.16,1:19:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...关于这枚戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...about this ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.44,1:19:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及事实的真相 真相 老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About the truth. The truth, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.24,1:19:57.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大马基诺斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damaskinos.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.80,1:20:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妮莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nyssa.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.40,1:21:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done a great job.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.20,1:21:42.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该说 不太漂亮吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that great, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.12,1:22:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦 女儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.80,1:22:18.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让你脸上无光爸爸...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.07,1:22:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我害家族蒙羞
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.57,1:22:30.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋战士救了我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.87,1:22:35.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个可敬的勇士
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.67,1:22:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.70,1:22:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还活着吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.56,1:23:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武器被他们拿走了 所有武器 包括你的剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took them. All our weapons. Even your sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.76,1:23:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有人不断通风报信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's been keeping tabs on us from inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.28,1:23:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.60,1:23:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们巢穴里的一个密室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of chamber deep in their lair.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.12,1:23:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的工作站全被他们毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They smashed up everything, the workshop, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.88,1:23:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从一开始就被骗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been lying to us from day one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.52,1:23:21.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,R异体家族并不会演化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Reaper strain didn't evolve.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.36,1:23:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个骗局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was designed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.16,1:23:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 我们被设计了 诺玛说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?  - Designed. Nomak told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.12,1:23:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在下水道里碰到他 他饶了我一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him back in the sewers. He let me live.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.56,1:23:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.56,1:23:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还真大方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How generous of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.84,1:23:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带你来看辉煌的战果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you here to see the fruits of our labor.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.64,1:23:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多年来 我努力不懈 为了去除遗传上的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years I've struggled to rid our kind of any hereditary weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.40,1:23:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现重组DNA 是唯一可行的一条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so recombining DNA was simply the next logical step.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.76,1:24:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺玛是第一个试验品 瑕疵品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nomak was the first. A failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.64,1:24:07.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但 不久 将有纯正的新品种...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in time, there will be a new pure race...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.92,1:24:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...来自我们自己的血肉...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...begotten from my own flesh...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.60,1:24:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...对银制品免疫...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...immune to silver...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.60,1:24:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...很快 甚至无惧阳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...soon even sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.24,1:24:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个问题 大骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a question for you, you lying son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.88,1:24:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺玛怎会有这枚戒指?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to explain how Nomak got ahold of this ring?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.04,1:24:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今还不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have thought that was obvious at this point.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.60,1:24:41.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给他的，父亲给儿子的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave it to him, of course. A gift from father to son.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.28,1:24:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为他不会逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought he'd never leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.80,1:25:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼跟绵羊和平相处太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wolf has lain with the sheep long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.96,1:25:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷哈特 该说拜拜啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reinhardt, you can kiss your ass goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.28,1:25:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, huh. I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.00,1:25:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别浪费时间 那是枚哑弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B, you're wasting your time, man. The bomb's a dud.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.20,1:25:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不会爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was never supposed to explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.52,1:25:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是让你吓人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just supposed to make you feel in control.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.96,1:25:31.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我被你吃定了 老大?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thought you had me on a short leash, didn't you, jefe?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.24,1:25:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much better.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.84,1:25:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See this?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.52,1:25:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是大马基诺斯家族成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm one of Damaskinos'familiars.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.32,1:25:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要我带你来搞定诺玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They needed my help to bring you here to control Nomak.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.08,1:25:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老废物只是个饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old fuck, he was always just bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.40,1:25:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看他 他就是你真正的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, look at him. He's your only real weakness, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.36,1:26:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你再迅速 强悍...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may be fast, you may be strong and all that other bullshit...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.96,1:26:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...但终究 刀兄 你太有人性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but in the end, B, you're just too human.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.00,1:26:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你是块废料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.72,1:26:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嘿  - 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heh.  - Unh.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.88,1:26:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为他们破解了保全系统?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think they scoped out my security system?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.96,1:26:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我放他们进来的 笨蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let them in, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.96,1:26:21.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本是拿钥匙给他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I practically handed them the keys.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.40,1:26:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到光头说的吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard Cue Ball, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.92,1:26:25.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快他们也成白昼游侠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty soon they're all gonna be daywalkers, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.72,1:26:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁可当宠物也不要当食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When that happens, I'd rather be a pet than cattle.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.20,1:26:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂了吗 老刀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got me, B?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.08,1:26:36.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有什么高见?  - 两件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think about that, man?  - Two things.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.16,1:26:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一 从你被招降开始 我就一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, I've been onto you since they turned you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.36,1:26:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And two...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.48,1:26:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...那不是枚哑弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it's not a dud.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.76,1:26:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠 帅毙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.76,1:27:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才刚开始喜欢他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just starting to like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.84,1:27:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.96,1:27:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会善用你每一滴血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to harvest your blood, every drop of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.72,1:27:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 骨髓 器官无一遗漏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then bone marrow, organs, everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.80,1:27:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找出成为白昼游侠的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find the missing key to creating daywalkers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.32,1:27:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 会有点痛哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this might hurt a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.64,1:28:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.40,1:28:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.12,1:28:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...他用它杀了多少吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how many vampires he's killed with this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.04,1:28:11.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不够多 奥国猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not nearly enough, Fritz.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.52,1:28:14.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续耍嘴皮子 老粗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep talking, honky-tonk.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.12,1:28:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送你上西天时 我会让你舒畅无比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just makes my sending you to the next world all the sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.48,1:28:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唬谁 看多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been there, done thet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.52,1:28:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越狠越好 孬种 帐我们慢慢再算 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do your worst, chickenshit. We'll settle up after.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.84,1:28:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么我不知道的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else should I find out?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.80,1:28:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全信赖你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trusted you...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.20,1:28:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我的手下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with my men...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.64,1:28:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...我的意志...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with my will...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.04,1:28:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...以及我的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.20,1:29:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 叫我们出生入死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, you sent us out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.80,1:29:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我们替你卖命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sent me to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.92,1:29:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的敌人救了我两次 你却在利用我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our enemy saved my life twice, and you have used us...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.92,1:29:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...利用自己的骨肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your own children.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.96,1:29:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得没错 妮莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make no mistake, Nyssa.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.60,1:29:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我们种族里 跟权势相比...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those blood ties mean nothing to me...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.40,1:29:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...骨肉之亲算得了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when measured against the ascendancy of our race.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.56,1:29:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为上帝会眷顾谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think God really favors in the web?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.00,1:29:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蜘蛛还是落网的苍蝇?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spider or the fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.00,1:29:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 诺玛  - 嗯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nomak.  - Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.28,1:29:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.80,1:29:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要复仇...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants revenge...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.60,1:30:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...针对他的创造者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on the people who created him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.52,1:30:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的可能没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.72,1:30:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜他不知道这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But fortunately for us, he doesn't know this location.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.44,1:30:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.92,1:30:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...他知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he does.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.44,1:30:47.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.44,1:31:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作 当着我的面你别想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, kid. Don't you even think about dying on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.64,1:31:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没放弃过我 我不会放弃你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't give up on me, I won't give up on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.80,1:31:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作点 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.60,1:32:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.72,1:32:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.76,1:32:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.96,1:32:46.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.92,1:32:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他进不来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll never enter here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.92,1:32:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.44,1:33:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.52,1:33:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.36,1:33:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.76,1:36:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.68,1:36:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去杀他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.00,1:36:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.28,1:36:56.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 就像我爸杀我妈时说的:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, like my daddy said right before he killed my mom:
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.44,1:36:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"想搞得定 非亲自动手不可"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Want anything done right, you gotta do it yourself."
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.28,1:37:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also said...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.08,1:37:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会不会脸红?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you blush?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.04,1:37:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着 小伙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.60,1:38:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我重设了密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I reset the security code.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.36,1:38:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们被锁住了  - 你疯了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're locked in.  - Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.60,1:38:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们两个都会没命  - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'll kill us both.  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.52,1:38:36.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悲哀吧 不是死在敌人之手...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it sad that you die not by the hand of your enemy...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.00,1:38:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...却死在自己子女手中?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but by that of your own children?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.96,1:38:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.81,1:38:53.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生在你身上的事
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.21,1:39:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是桩可怕的悲剧
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.01,1:39:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个不能原谅的错误
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.01,1:39:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你却回来纠缠不清
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.11,1:39:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会找到解药的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.61,1:39:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你重享应有的地位
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.61,1:39:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你重享应有的地位 我们一起征服世界
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.11,1:39:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你说的是实话
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.51,1:39:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么声音会颤抖?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.91,1:39:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.31,1:40:11.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让你死 不用受我这种苦
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.91,1:40:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经由这个伤口 你的生命得以流传
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.88,1:40:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妮莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nyssa.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.53,1:40:50.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥 杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.03,1:40:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,断绝这个家族
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.83,1:40:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.10,1:41:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是他最钟爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.60,1:41:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nomak!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.52,1:41:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刀锋 可以在此作个总结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade, it could end right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.00,1:41:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.00,1:44:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没结束呢 看来得由我完成父亲的工作 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, it looks like I've finished my father's job.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.24,1:45:31.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.28,1:45:34.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.00,1:45:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛苦不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hurts no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.64,1:46:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不了多久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.92,1:46:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经感觉体内的灼热了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can already feel it burning inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.04,1:46:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁我还是吸血鬼时我想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to die while I'm still a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.72,1:47:06.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看看太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.50,1:48:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(伦敦)
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.76,1:48:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3号亭 好好爽一爽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to booth number three. Enjoy, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.76,1:48:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女孩是"真"的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure, uh, that the girls are live?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.08,1:48:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 刚检查过  - 谢啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Last time I checked.  - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.80,1:49:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剃刀带着 以备不时之需\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple of razor blades, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.44,1:49:11.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我忘掉你了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you didn't think I forgot about you, did you?
